A prior commit (d040605) extracted Reputation Manager's minimal-client
insert into its own function but wrote it in place over
create-minimal-engagement.ts instead of creating
create-minimal-rep-engagement.ts as a new file — destroying Showtime's
original createMinimalEngagement export in the process and leaving
teammates/chat/route.ts importing a function from a file that no
longer had it, plus a second file that never existed. Restored the
original Showtime function from its last known-good commit (58c611b)
and moved the Reputation Manager version to the filename it was always
meant to live at. Fixes a hard production build failure
(TS2724/module-not-found on both imports).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
